{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Talk to Suspicious Patient)
:'''Suspicious Patient:''' Why haven't I gone for my follow-up visit... Are you a patient too, or did Dr. Natasha send you over?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What makes you say that?
::'''Suspicious Patient:''' Who else would care about people like me?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You're pretty sharp.
::'''Suspicious Patient:''' Hah, you should head on back then. Thank Dr. Natasha for her concern.
:'''Suspicious Patient:''' I don't need Dr. Natasha's help now. Tell her to save her worries and medicine for other people.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Did you have a dispute with her?
::'''Suspicious Patient:''' A dispute? No, no, she's the only kindhearted doctor in the Underworld.
::'''Suspicious Patient:''' I just don't really approve of her methods, that's all. Too idealistic, and no real efficacy...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I'm through seeing her too...
::'''Suspicious Patient:''' Huh? So you had a dispute with her?
::'''Suspicious Patient:''' ...She's the only kindhearted doctor in the Underworld. I just don't really approve of her methods, that's all. Too idealistic, and no real efficacy...
:'''Suspicious Patient:''' She tries to save everyone, which means she can't save anyone... In the end, it's the patients who suffer, and she just tires herself out.
:'''Suspicious Patient:''' Miners like me don't have time for lengthy treatments... If I can't take something and get right back to work, I may as well lie down and wait for death to come knocking...
:'''Suspicious Patient:''' Did you know Dr. Vache? His wonder medicine is cheap and the results are immediate. You just need to be willing to... take a little risk.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} "Risk"?
:'''Suspicious Patient:''' Dr. Vache's medicine is... different. Lots of people make a full recovery after taking it... but some get worse, and the unlucky ones check out early.
