:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} They're willing to gamble with their life...
::'''Suspicious Patient:''' Hmph, you're smarter than you look.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I've no idea.
::'''Suspicious Patient:''' Hmph... you've clearly never been in really dire straits.
