{{Mission Description|type=companion|location=Rivet Town|update|Natasha has decided to destroy the mutual aid society that sells counterfeit drugs with your help.<br />You defeat the gatekeepers of the mutual aid society. The wonder medicine must be hidden nearby.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

----
:'''Society President:''' Blast it... What did we ever do to you? Why are you taking away our money-maker!?
:'''Natasha:''' "...Money-maker"?
:'''Natasha:''' So you admit it, then? You're not in this to save lives. You're in it to get rich.
----
:'''Society President:''' Wh&mdash;What are you doing here? Ugh, as if we didn't have enough trouble already...
:'''Natasha:''' ...Selling fake medicine with false kindness. You should have expected trouble to find you sooner or later.
:'''Natasha:''' I have a responsibility to protect the well-being of my patients... or to put it another way: I must eradicate any and all threats to them.
:'''Society President:''' You... You can't save everyone! The Underworld is teeming with sickness... how could you possibly pull it off!
:'''Natasha:''' You're right, I can't save everyone alone... but if I must, I would sacrifice food and sleep to treat them.
:'''Natasha:''' The debt that Vache owes to the Underworld rests with me. All I can do is help everyone to the best of my ability... to the very end.
:'''Society President:''' ...
:'''Society President:''' Ugh... So stubborn... In that sense, you're no different from your crazy brother.
:'''Natasha:''' ...I'll take that as a compliment.
:'''Natasha:''' Thank you, (Trailblazer). Your actions today have saved many Underworld families.
:'''Natasha:''' I'll find a way to dispose of Vache's leftover reagents. Next time the "Mutual Aid Society" wants to whip up a quack cure? They'll be out of luck.
:'''Natasha:''' Let's go back to town. I still owe those patients an explanation...
