:'''Alert Vagrant:''' You're the same as everyone else that comes through here. If you want medicine, you don't need to go any further &mdash; you talk to me.
:'''Alert Vagrant:''' And we only take cash, this ain't a charity...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I heard the medicine here is pretty cheap.
