::'''Alert Vagrant:''' ...Well, are you buying or not? Spit it out. I don't have time for chit-chat.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What if a patient doesn't have the money?
::'''Alert Vagrant:''' No money? Then you don't get any. You go home and wait for death.
::'''Alert Vagrant:''' ...Say, what are you trying to pull here? If you can't afford it, then get outta my sight. I've got medicine to sell.
:'''Alert Vagrant:''' Wait a minute, your clothes... Are you friends with that doctor woman? I've seen you at the clinic before &mdash; I know it!
